[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6961.55, "timestamp": "01:56:01", "text": "我的来源名称是什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6969.589, "timestamp": "01:56:09", "text": "捕获。这是哪张截图？迪奥。等待。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6971.79, "timestamp": "01:56:11", "text": "好的。这"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6974.27, "timestamp": "01:56:14", "text": "一。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6977.43, "timestamp": "01:56:17", "text": "玩家速度模糊效果。好的。知道了。知道了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6980.149, "timestamp": "01:56:20", "text": "它应该随时都能运行。不。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6982.149, "timestamp": "01:56:22", "text": "好的。它在这里应该可以正常工作。它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6987.07, "timestamp": "01:56:27", "text": "应该可以正常工作了。是的，应该如此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6991.03, "timestamp": "01:56:31", "text": "好的。所以我做了些修改，现在它会进行检查。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6994.47, "timestamp": "01:56:34", "text": "主动检查我的电脑里有没有游戏"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6997.75, "timestamp": "01:56:37", "text": "exe 文件之类的东西，然后它会修改一些东西，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7000.39, "timestamp": "01:56:40", "text": "呃，在 OBS 中触发一些东西。不是吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7002.31, "timestamp": "01:56:42", "text": "方便吗？所以我不用担心"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7004.709, "timestamp": "01:56:44", "text": "哦，我忘了打开模糊功能。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7008.39, "timestamp": "01:56:48", "text": "忘了把小地图模糊处理之类的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7010.79, "timestamp": "01:56:50", "text": "等等。所以我不必担心"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7014.669, "timestamp": "01:56:54", "text": "我玩《Valerant》或《Apex》。"}]